From abc4c8c5648a39d2773b5604383b6625671e6faa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Destrudos6 <3411622425@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:55:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 23/51] Add a bilingual reader page for cached subtitles

The cached subtitles were only viewable as raw VTT text in a dialog.
They are a valuable learning resource, so tapping an entry keeps the
quick dialog preview but now leads into a dedicated reader page
showing the original and the translation as parallel lines.

- Reader page pushed onto the settings stack from the cache list
  (fade animation, back returns to the list)
- Mode switcher at the top: bilingual, original only or translation
  only, to re-read the transcript as a comprehension exercise
- Deleting a cache entry moved to long-press on the list entry, since
  the viewer dialog now leads with the reader action
